# Ensure evidence screenshots and design artifacts under docs/evidence are tracked.
# Do NOT ignore docs/evidence/ or its contents — these screenshots are required in PRs.
!docs/evidence/
!docs/evidence/**

# If an overarching docs/ was ever added to ignores elsewhere, allow the evidence folder explicitly
# (keeps other docs files free to be tracked normally)
!docs/